  "negative_findings": [
    "Historical source publication and final-whistle times are not proved; capture timestamps are from 2026 and no pregame or same-day PIT backcast is permitted.",
    "SportsDataverse schedule data is ESPN-derived and is not independent confirmation of CFBD upstream truth.",
    "Eighteen zero-score SportsDataverse rows are postponed schedule aliases, not outcomes; their rescheduled final rows map to the same canonical games.",
    "Two additional SportsDataverse alias groups contain duplicate final source IDs with identical participants, kickoff, and score; they remain source aliases rather than extra games.",
    "Two supplement-only schedules were canceled and remain nonoutcomes with scores cleared rather than treated as 0-0 ties.",
    "Four supplement-only completed records are postseason all-star games and remain separately source-lineaged rather than silently represented as CFBD coverage.",
